nglish streaming pay-as-you-go. Vendor flags it as a limited-time promotional rate; flux-general-multi is $0.0078.\">$0.0065</span></p></div><div><p><span>—</span></p><p>Scribe v2 Realtimeelevenlabs：scribe_v2_realtime</p><p><span>—</span><span title=\"Scribe v2 Realtime at $0.39/hr, flat across every tier. Batch Scribe v2 is $0.0037.\">$0.0065</span></p></div><div><p><span>—</span></p><p>GPT 实时转录openai:gpt-live-transcribe</p><p><span>—</span><span title=\"gpt-live-transcribe, the streaming path this row is recommended for.\">$0.0170</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div id=\"gateway\"><h2>网关</h2><p>每个提供者面前都有一个基本 URL 和一把密钥，使用您的框架已经调用的 API。</p></div><div id=\"integrate\"><div><h2>运行并观察您的语音工作者</h2><p>Speko 使用 OpenAI API，因此您已经使用的框架需要主机名和模型字符串。</p></div><div><pre><code><span>import</span><span> { defineAgent, voice } </span><span>from</span><span> </span><span>'@livekit/agents'</span><span>;\n</span><span>import</span><span> * </span><span>as</span><span> openai </span><span>from</span><span> </span><span>'@livekit/agents-plugin-openai'</span><span>;\n\n</span><span>const</span><span> key = </span><span>process</span><span>.env.SPEKO_API_KEY!;\n</span><span>const</span><span> baseURL = </span><span>'https://api.speko.ai/v1'</span><span>;\n\n</span><span>export</span><span> </span><span>default</span><span> defineAgent({\n  entry: </span><span>async</span><span> (ctx) =&gt; {\n    </span><span>const</span><span> session = </span><span>new</span><span> voice.AgentSession({\n      stt: </span><span>new</span><span> openai.STT({ apiKey: key, baseURL, model: </span><mark>'auto'</mark><span> }),\n      llm: </span><span>new</span><span> openai.LLM({ apiKey: key, baseURL, model: </span><mark>'auto'</mark><span> }),\n      tts: </span><span>new</span><span> openai.TTS({ apiKey: key, baseURL, model: </span><mark>'auto'</mark><span> }),\n    });\n    </span><span>await</span><span> session.start({ agent: </span><span>new</span><span> voice.Agent({ ... }) });\n  },\n});</span></code></pre></div></div></div><div><h2>将您的代理指向 Speko</h2><div><pre><span>$</span><span><span>claude</span></span><span> <span>mcp</span></span><span> <span>add</span></span><span> <span>--transport</span></span><span> <span>http</span></span><span> <span>speko</span></span><span> <span>https://mcp.speko.ai/mcp</span></span></pre></div></div></div></div>"}